    "rich_text_jngJQR": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_Wt7yU7": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Awaken the Ancient Light Within",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_ziF69K": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "enlarge_text": true,
            "text": "<p><strong>The Ultimate Tour of the Greatest Show on Earth</strong></p><p>Join visionary author and mystic explorer William Henry on a once-in-a lifetime pilgrimage through the sacred sites of Ancient Egypt — the land of the gods, star beings, and divine ascension. This is more than a tour — it is an activation journey, a quest for the living wisdom of the ancient Starwalkers encoded in the temples, tombs, and timeless stones of this amazing land. </p><p>Something profound is happening in Egypt. Almost daily we hear of new discoveries, new possibilities. From the Giza Plateau to the Valley of the Kings revelations abound. It’s all about ancient civilizations, stargates and transformation. All part of William’s expertise. </p><p>On this exclusive journey, open to just 32 guests, you will walk the path of the initiates — from the Great Pyramid of Giza to the Temple of Isis at Philae, from Luxor and Karnak to the Valley of the Kings — guided by William’s deep and original insight into ancient Egyptian sacred technologies, Starwalker symbolism, and the mysteries of ascension.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_Wt7yU7",
        "text_ziF69K"
      ],
