    "columns_1_xUtgUC": {
      "type": "columns-1",
      "blocks": {
        "dropdown_UDRJYr": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Day 1: Cairo – Tuesday, October 20th",
            "text": "<p>Upon arrival at Cairo Airport, you will be met by our Abercrombie & Kent tour manager who will assist you through customs and immigration before transferring you to your luxury accommodations at the Nile Four Seasons, Cairo. We’ll have an opening meeting, then enjoy our first evening together.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Cairo_Airport_1.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#274150",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "dropdown_m6Bgrp": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Day 2: Cairo - Wednesday, October 21st",
            "text": "<p>We begin our Starwalker journey at the Grand Egyptian Museum, coming face to face with amazing masterpieces of Ancient Egypt, including the treasures of King Tutankhamun (all decoded by William). Overnight Four Seasons. Breakfast and lunch included.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Tutankhamun_golden_throne.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#42617f",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "dropdown_ybWNAH": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Day 3: Saqqara - Thursday, October 22nd",
            "text": "<p>Today we explore Saqqara, the original ‘Starwalker Mystery School’, home of the Step Pyramid or ‘Stairway to Heaven’, followed by the awe-inspiring Serapeum. Overnight Four Seasons. Breakfast and lunch included.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Step_Pyramid_Of_Djoser_Saqqara-2.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#63809f",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "dropdown_keHFDe": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Day 4: Luxor - Friday, October 23rd",
            "text": "<p>Transfer to beautiful Luxor and walk the sacred stones of Karnak Temple. Overnight Al Madoura Hotel, Luxor. Breakfast and lunch included.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Temple_of_Khonsu_Karnak_Temple_Luxor.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#274150",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "dropdown_LQRUQw": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Day 5: Luxor (West Bank) - Saturday, October 24th",
            "text": "<p>Today, we tour the West Bank of the Nile with visits to Hatshepsut's temple, the Valley of Kings, and the astounding Colossi of Memnon, finishing with the incredible Medinet Habu temple. Breakfast and lunch included.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Mortuary_Temple_of_Hatshepsut.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#42617f",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "dropdown_WfUBR8": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Day 6: Luxor - Sunday, October 25th",
            "text": "<p>After transferring to the Sunboat III, we will enjoy a visit to the Luxor Temple. The SB III is a truly spoiling experience - listed as one of Condé Nast’s Top 100 most beautiful boats in the world. You will experience the ultimate in service, superb food, delightful staff, and exquisite amenities. Breakfast, lunch & dinner included.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Sanctuary_Sun_Boat_Nile_River.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#63809f",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "dropdown_zkKE87": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Day 7: Denderah - Monday, October 26th",
            "text": "<p>This Easter morning, we enjoy a peaceful drive through the Egyptian countryside to Denderah to visit the exquisite temple dedicated to Hathor, the goddess of abundance, love, and joy. Breakfast, lunch & dinner included.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Wall_carving_Temple_of_Hathor_Dendera_Temple_complex.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#274150",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "dropdown_yN3NJi": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Day 8: Edfu - Tuesday, October 27th",
            "text": "<p>Edfu is next as we continue our exploration of the incredible collection of Ptolemaic temples that encode the secrets of the Starwalkers. Breakfast, lunch & dinner included.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Carved_relief_Temple_of_Edfu.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#42617f",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "dropdown_LEWRH7": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Day 9: Aswan - Wednesday, October 28th",
            "text": "<p>Today, we visit Philae to receive the blessings of Isis-Hathor, the goddess of love and joy, at her beautiful island temple. Breakfast, lunch & dinner included.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Temple_of_Hathor_Aswan.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#63809f",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "dropdown_CPpRce": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Day 10: Giza - Thursday, October 29th",
            "text": "<p>Today, we fly to Cairo. Upon landing, we follow the path of the Holy Family with a visit to Old Cairo. This evening we have a special private visit to the Great Pyramid, including the King’s Chamber. Overnight Mena House Hotel, Giza. Breakfast and lunch included.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Group_picture_Pyramid_background.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#274150",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "dropdown_RAmpQz": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Day 11: Giza - Friday, October 30th",
            "text": "<p>The Sphinx welcomes us as we enjoy a private visit to integrate all the wonders we have seen. Farewell dinner. Overnight Mena House Hotel, Giza. Breakfast and dinner included.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Group_pictures_Great_Sphinx_of_Gaza-2.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#42617f",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "dropdown_MaPNb9": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Day 12: Departure - Saturday, October 31st",
            "text": "<p>Journey home.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Cairo_Airport_2.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#63809f",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
