    "text_and_image_pQtyM7": {
      "type": "text-and-image",
      "name": "t:sections.text-and-image.presets.image_with_text.name",
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/HERO_SHOT.jpg",
        "image_mask": "rounded",
        "image2_mask": "none",
        "subtitle": "",
        "title": "Meet Your Guide",
        "heading_size": "h2",
        "text": "<h3>William Henry</h3><p>With over 20 years of experience leading over 30 groups to Egypt, William Henry is singularly experienced to bring you phenomenal insight into the mysteries of Ancient Egypt and how they are returning today. Experience the real story behind the ancient gods - not as myth, but as encoded blueprints of human transformation. Explore with William in person his remarkable original research into the ancient star boats of the gods and the mysteries of the ancient Starwalkers. Let Egypt’s sacred imagery, cosmic alignments, and temple codes ignite your soul memory and awaken your divine self.</p>",
        "button_label": "",
        "button_link": "",
        "button_style": "primary",
        "align_text": "left",
        "image_width": "50",
        "layout": "right",
        "color_scheme": "2",
        "show_wave": false,
        "divider": false,
        "top_padding": true,
        "bottom_padding": true,
        "lazyload_images": true
      }
    },
    "text_with_icons_KeYyrE": {
      "type": "text-with-icons",
      "blocks": {
        "text_block_EgR84Y": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "",
            "title": "HTB, Connecticut",
            "text": "<p>⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</p><p>“William, it is with the fondest of memories and deepest gratitude that I send this note of appreciation. The tour was a phenomenal experience!! This was primarily due to the care and devotion with which you crafted this experience for us all. You allowed us to have the opportunity to discover for ourselves the treasures you have spent decades digging and searching for. Treasures not hoarded for your personal gain, but treasures joyously and freely shared for all who aspire to greater heights! A true master of their craft makes the labor seem effortless as they perform their art. Evidencing the labor is born of love. It was truly an expanding experience for me! I thank you!! Bravo!!” </p>"
          }
        },
        "text_block_i88rjM": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "",
            "title": "MB, Florida",
            "text": "<p>⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</p><p>\"My soul and I thank you from the deepest chambers of my being. My gratitude is immeasurable for the guidance, the wisdom and the adventure. This pilgrimage through Egypt has been one of the great blessing and highlights of my life. Each day unfolded like scroll of divine wisdom -- a living classroom of heart, history and spirit -- where past, present and future collide.\" </p>"
          }
        }
      },
