    "columns_1_N4QetX": {
      "type": "columns-1",
      "blocks": {
        "dropdown_MpQ7eL": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Retail Price Inclusions",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>Private access inside the Great Pyramid and Paws of the Sphinx – Meditate in the King’s Chamber and feel the transformative power of this amazing ascension instrument.</p><p>Visit the Grand Egyptian Museum through William’s trained eye.</p><p>Luxor & Karnak Temples – Decode the ascension teachings of the ages.</p><p>Denderah -- William takes you into the heart of the Divine Feminine mysteries.</p><p>Temple of Horus at Edfu – Uncover the Starwalker legacy and the blueprint of resurrection.</p><p>Sailing the Nile – Drift down the river of eternity on the private  Sanctuary SunBoat III, surrounded by desert, sky, and stars.</p><p>Sacred Teachings – Daily mystical teaching and amazing historical presentations from William Henry, who has led over 30 tours to Egypt.</p><p>Conscious Community – Travel with a group of like-minded seekers devoted to connecting with the greatest mysteries of humanity.</p><p>An unmatched program of true five star hotels, an unparalleled boat and A&K service.</p>",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#274150",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "dropdown_ajAxaD": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Retail Price Exclusions",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>Private access inside the Great Pyramid and Paws of the Sphinx – Meditate in the King’s Chamber and feel the transformative power of this amazing ascension instrument.</p><p>Airfare from your country, and back to your country.</p><p>Entry visa to Egypt, which will cost approximately $25 USD per person.</p><p>Passport fees or charges (if any).</p><p>Travel Insurance (Cancellation and Medical Insurance).</p><p>Personal expenses, such as laundry service, mini bar charges, drinks with meals, and health club fees, etc.</p><p>Gratuities: $450 per person tipping for bus drivers, tour guides, hotel staff, restaurant staff, etc.</p><p>Extra meals not included in itinerary. </p><p>NOTE: Alcoholic beverages with meals are NOT included.</p><p>Emergency evacuation.<br/></p>",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#274150",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "dropdown_zxUc4t": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Reservation and Payment",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>To secure your booking, $5,000.00 non-refundable deposit for the reservation will be required at the time of booking. Please note that your booking will only be considered confirmed once the payment has been received.</p>",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#274150",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "dropdown_F3F9mP": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Cancellation and Refunds",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>If you choose to cancel your participation in this tour, we will not refund any deposits or subsequent payments regardless of circumstances. Given this policy, <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">we strongly suggest</span> that you purchase travel insurance in case of emergencies or unforeseen circumstances that may arise at your end.</p><p>Travel insurance will protect your investment in case of unforeseen situations or emergencies. If you choose to purchase travel insurance, <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">which we </span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>highly recommend</strong></span>, you must do so on your own. When you purchase this insurance, please take some time to double check what is covered. Each state has slightly different policies. Be sure that you are getting coverage that includes a refund if the Host of the retreat is unavailable to attend if you wish to apply that option.</p>",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#274150",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "dropdown_aMTFHh": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Waiver of Responsibility",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>By signing up to the Tour you agree to our Terms, Deposit Conditions and Waiver.</p><p>William Henry have worked diligently to make all the arrangements for our journey together in Egypt. However, William Henry will not be held liable for delays, theft, damage, injury, or any other irregularities that may occur during the journey. We will not be held liable for any changes or delays in airline schedules or missed connections; injury, loss, or damage to persons or property; additional expenses resulting from changes in exchange rates, tariffs, or itinerary; any transportation issues or problems with vehicles utilized on the tour; additional expenses incurred due to illness, weather conditions, protests, war, terrorism, quarantine, or other causes; and losses due to cancellations not subject to our Terms and Conditions. </p>",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#274150",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "dropdown_Ypd9Wp": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Changes",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>This Itinerary is subject to changes to adapt to possible alterations in domestic flight times or other unforeseen circumstances. The content will remain the same, barring any unanticipated complications, and will include many delightful “extras” and surprises.</p>",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#274150",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "dropdown_rzQq4A": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Insurance",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>We highly recommend that all participants obtain travel insurance. Travel Insured International offers insurance for trip cost, trip cancellation & interruption, and pays for loss due to unforeseen circumstance, death, injury, or illness to you or a member of your family. It also includes coverage for missed connections due to weather, pays for lost deposits due to the financial default of the airline, the tour operator, or cruise line. It pays for baggage delays, travel delays, medical expenses and emergency assistance.</p>",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#274150",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        }
      },
